// A random ROOM cell (always odd grid coordinates, see
// game/sim/maze/gen/run/genmaze.id's comment on the odd/even grid trick): 1 + 2*k
// for k in 0..room-count-1, where room-count = (cells-1)/2 for the grid's
// width or height in `cells`.

rand_room(int cells) {
  int room_cell = 1 + 2 * (random_next() % ((cells - 1) / 2));
} return int room_cell;
given random_initialize(1) (15):(1)
given random_initialize(127772) (15):(1) then calls random_next:[1]
given random_initialize(1) (13):(5)
given random_initialize(127772) (13):(7)
